body:
I notice in #20678 that there are several places where the `ParamsInheritanceStrategy` type could seemingly be used, but `'emptyOnly' | 'always'` is hard-coded instead. I'm not sure why the named type isn't used consistently.

@voithos, do you recall why the ParamsInheritanceStrategy type wasn't used consistently?

I'm also curious why this wasn't caught by testing. Is there some kind of test we can add that tries to compile the project after `stripInternal` step has been applied?
